micin, vancomycin hydrochloride, and teicoplanin for anti-bacterial applications; anidulafungin, caspofungi, micafungin sodium, and nystatin for anti-fungal therapeutic segment; and lovastatin and pravastatin sodium for other applications. Further, it develops daptomycin for anti-infectives applications; and epirubicin, idarubicin, and pirarubicin for oncology therapeutic segment. Additionally, the company provides contract research and manufacturing services in the areas of fermentation and semi-synthesis products. Concord Biotech Limited was incorporated in 1984 and is based in Ahmedabad, India."}}